  "summary": "I’m a results-driven Senior Software Engineer with a passion for building scalable, high-impact solutions that streamline operations and enhance business outcomes. At Liberty Mutual, I’ve led key initiatives, including the development of a new AWS serverless transformation service that’s projected to save $46,000 annually and reclaim 5,000 business hours. Beyond coding, I take pride in mentoring engineers, improving DevOps practices, and driving technical excellence. At the moment, I am seeking ways to have a significant impact on mission-critical systems. \n\nMy professional tech stack includes Java, Spring Boot, TypeScript, Node.js, AWS (Lambda, API Gateway, SQS, EventBridge, DynamoDB, ElastiCache), and MySQL, while I love to play with Dart, Flutter, and Next.js on my own time. I’m always eager to collaborate with like-minded engineers, share knowledge, and explore opportunities to make a bigger impact—feel free to reach out via chat.",
