      "description": "- Developed core backend services for a $25M commercial insurance platform serving the European market, enabling brokers and underwriters to create submissions, generate quotes, and bind policies.\n- Led the design and delivery of the platform’s document management and generation component, integrating with Amazon S3 for storage and enabling automated policy document generation.\n- Architected and implemented services using ApigeeX as the external API proxy, to connect to our serverless backend build using Amazon API Gateway, SQS, Lambda, Step Functions, and DynamoDB.\n- Defined squad norms and drove engineering excellence by enhancing CI/CD pipelines and introducing standardized tooling, including shared Postman collections, automated testing, and deployment processes.\n- Mentored fellow Senior Engineers through architectural reviews, debugging sessions, and maintainability improvements—fostering a peer-mentorship culture and encouraging high standards of code quality.\n- Operated as a team lead—taking ownership of delivery, engineering practices, and coordination.",
