      "totalDuration": "3 yrs 1 mo",
      "description": "- Led the development of various Salesforce integrations using Spring Boot and Spring Batch to process over 100,000 records at once.\n- Directed the build-out of the external Liberty Mutual Canada WordPress website, while managing and maintaining the Liberty Mutual business and Helmsman websites, which have an estimated combined monthly traffic of about 55,000 visitors.\n- Spearheaded the team's GitHub migration and the department's ApigeeX migration.\n- Coached and mentored over 11 new team members, including interns, contractors, and full-time employees.",
